Not included
------------
This project ships no Apple assets. Apple TV, tvOS and SF Symbols are
trademarks of Apple Inc.; SF Symbols is licensed for use on Apple platforms
only, so none of its artwork is bundled here. The launcher only imitates the
visual language (thin rounded strokes, large landscape cards, a focus engine
that scales, lifts and tilts the selection).
